NOTE ON BUNDLED THIRD-PARTY RUNTIME

The `rk3588_zero_copy/third_party/` directory ships Rockchip runtime binaries
(`librknnrt.so`, `librga.so`) and their headers. These files are NOT covered by
the MIT License above; they remain the property of Rockchip Electronics and are
distributed under the Rockchip EULA for the sole purpose of running this
project on RK3588 hardware.
